{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13518","headline":"山中作 · 沈千运","name":"山中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖隐非别事，所愿离风尘。\n不辞城邑游，礼乐拘束人。\n迩来归山林，庶事皆吾身。\n何者爲形骸，谁是智与仁。\n寂寞了闲事，而後知天真。\n咳唾矜崇华，迂俯相屈伸。\n如何巢与由，天子不知臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈千运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}